WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.640
Today it's sumo suit ping pong!

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:11.880
That looked pretty easy

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.860
That was smooth

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.480
Looks like Otto's done that before

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.220
It wasn't that hard

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:18.820
No

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.080
You guys look hilarious

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.180
I might have this wrong way around

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.560
Yeah...

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.260
Otto you have it the wrong way around!

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.700
Otto looks like a sumo warrior

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.660
You both look like warriors

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:31.880
And guys

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.500
Don't forget to hit subscribe!

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.000
Emil run!

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:54.800
Almost

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:55.900
Come on Emil

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.120
You can do it

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:58.060
You can do it!

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:00.320
So close

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:03.600
Yes I got it

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.260
Is it hot inside the suit?

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:23.520
It's quite warm

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:26.660
Imagine how many sweaty people have been in that suit

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:33.800
I couldn't reach it!

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.280
It doesn't seem to be affecting Otto

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:45.900
Not much, no.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.500
You got the full weight behind that smash

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.180
I didn't beat him in a ping pong match

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:57.260
but I can beat him in a sumo...

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.320
Okay, I lost both matches.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:03.740
Whats your tactic?

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.220
I'm just going to crawl in

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:06.560
Okay see you

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:07.700
See you on the other side

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.220
I'm not sure why but

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.580
Miikka looks even funnier in the dress

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.400
It's just a...

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.460
Like a small round guy

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:46.940
I feel like my weight is doubled

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.100
Ah come on

00:02:59.420 --> 00:02:59.920
Try

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:01.100
You can do it

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:04.100
Almost

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:09.540
There

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:11.860
No!

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.620
I'm not getting up for the second one

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:50.100
Now I'm stuck again

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.100
I think my shoelaces are undone

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.280
Miikka is more on the floor than he's

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:58.940
actually on his feet

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:12.140
I mean

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:13.540
He plays like normal

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:55.720
Thanks

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:00.320
It's funny to see the reactions from people

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.400
There is suddenly a guy with a sumo suit

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:04.340
Hello

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:26.580
Yes!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:39.900
What's happening there?

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:50.220
It's like a...

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.040
Sleeping position!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.760
It's quite comfortable actually

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.520
It's surprisingly comfortable!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:06.920
Don't forget to hit subscribe

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.600
And watch our previous
episodes there!

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:09.800
Until next time!

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:13.520
Miikka you can come up already

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:14.460
Miikka?

